Or Haskell/ml style? Significant whitespace? Use $ operator? No. 

-->! $root keypath *agent-id, multi-path [:result, termval clojure(aor-types/->AgentResult "agent completed" true)], [:finished-time-millis, termval *millis]

Hmm.


I think just having a (clojure block, and just run the clojure reader on that string. Also, I want it to be c-style syntax. Heretical. But delicious. 

